{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/lucky-oasis-residence-lucky-aeon-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":307,"crm_id":"2378","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Lucky Oasis Residence","slug":"lucky-oasis-residence-lucky-aeon-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Lucky Aeon","price":632999,"display_price":"632K","lattitude":25.05195,"longitude":55.214405,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Lucky Oasis Residence is a residential complex consisting of 15 floors, which was developed in the JVC (Jumeirah Village Circle). The developer of this project is Lucky Aeon.</p><p>In this building, luxury and comfort are ideally combined with functionality and thoughtfulness in every detail.</p><p>Lucky Oasis Residence offers a choice of <strong>studios, one, two and three bedroom apartments.</strong> Every detail of the interior is chosen and thought out with the utmost care to make your life better. Here you can show your refined taste and enjoy increased comfort.</p><p>In the kitchen you will find sophisticated design that is ideally combined with functionality. From sleek countertops to high-quality appliances, every element is designed to transform your culinary experience.</p><p>If you love golf, then the state-of-the-art simulator will allow you to enjoy realistic gameplay and virtual courses from around the world. For fitness enthusiasts, there is a fully equipped gym with the most modern machines and the ability to create an individual training program.</p><p>If you are looking for a place to practice yoga, then a yoga room is the perfect choice. Here you can improve your mindfulness and relaxation through a variety of activities and meditation sessions.</p><p>Just 15 minutes from the complex is Burj Al Arab, 20 minutes from Palm Jumeirah, Burj Khalifa and Mall of the Emirates, and 30 minutes from Dubai International Airport.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2378/images/2024/06/28/uTTQrV8IMCk8XnNtfULXb72EeBseM6ayRUpXTQwW.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/28/uTTQrV8IMCk8XnNtfULXb72EeBseM6ayRUpXTQwW.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2378/images/2024/06/28/bNazloxRFnlPAoTEg8UhBzzka3ca7XJInROK70bk.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/28/bNazloxRFnlPAoTEg8UhBzzka3ca7XJInROK70bk.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2378/images/2024/06/28/I503kpkwmb2aIZHp0OqVH6QN0Ff38qWPhFW93duH.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/28/I503kpkwmb2aIZHp0OqVH6QN0Ff38qWPhFW93duH.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2378/images/2024/06/28/xY0VzccvHOIexasjlXc4Nm67aKjUJe35mFiUqI1G.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/28/xY0VzccvHOIexasjlXc4Nm67aKjUJe35mFiUqI1G.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2378/images/2024/06/28/Oy8RI3r0YjJJaccstt7UBjKNywQiLDcSAw7LlKWX.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/28/Oy8RI3r0YjJJaccstt7UBjKNywQiLDcSAw7LlKWX.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2378/images/2024/06/28/9QW6nHifR1aMWZ9ogrmsPFNiOVXgdwZoVreVznL0.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/28/9QW6nHifR1aMWZ9ogrmsPFNiOVXgdwZoVreVznL0.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2835,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/06/28/9bCrQaVvUcD8Q9mgg8ffWNp3k8jAO7doTD6xHPoL.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"imag